Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level 2 & 1 Constraints", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"aeb490cb-c121-496d-a7b1-2b5a319e4f70"],

Cell["\<\
Eliminate the level 2 functions using independent linear equations. The \
remaining constraints reduce to two quadratics in the single level 1 \
function. Exact polynomial multiples verify this reduction; their resultant \
gives the spectral curve.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d8ea9b7b-2fda-4957-8189-3d6eef69bdff"],

